---
source: https://www.karissasvegankitchen.com/vegan-worcestershire-sauce/
prep time: 2 minutes
cook time: 5 minutes
total time: 7 minutes
servings: 12
---

Add @apple cider vinegar{1%cup}, @soy sauce{1/3%cup}, @brown sugar{3%Tbsp}, @Dijon mustard{1%tsp}, @ground allspice{1/2%tsp}, @garlic powder{1/2%tsp}, @onion powder{1/2%tsp}, and @black pepper{1/8%tsp} to a #pot{}, and cover. Turn the heat on low and heat until it is just barely brought to a simmer, about ~{5%minutes}.

Remove from the heat and allow to cool to room temperature.

Store in a #jar{} in the #refrigerator{} for up to 1 to 2 months.
